{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37191","headline":"秋日寄华阳山人 · 高蟾","name":"秋日寄华阳山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云木送秋何草草，风波凝冷太星星。\n银鞍公子魂俱断，玉弩将军涕自零。\n茅洞白龙和雨看，荆溪黄鹄带霜听。\n人间不见清凉事，犹向溪翁乞画屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}